{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0842a4d2-1330-8948-837d-26895e9808e4",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T10:49:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anh Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:45:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about a pothole. Well, it was patched, the cold patch from last week, but it's washed out now. With the rain today it's just gone, and there's a hole again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a pothole that was filled last week with the cold patch and the rain has washed it out. Let me get that started for you. What street is it on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on Thames Street, um, near the corner of Williams. Like right before the corner if you're heading south."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thames near Williams, heading south, right before the corner. Is it in the travel lane or over by the parking side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Travel lane. Kind of the right side of it, so you can't really miss it unless you swerve, and then, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:46:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Right side of the travel lane. And how big would you say it is? Just roughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe a foot and a half across? And pretty deep. It's filling up with water right now so I can't tell exactly [pause] but deeper than the first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a foot and a half across, deep, and holding water. I'll put all of that in the report. Did you hit it, or are you just reporting it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:47:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I mean, I almost hit it this morning. I haven't had damage. But I wanted to ask, does the city reimburse for car damage? Like if somebody does hit it and hurts a tire or whatever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. There is a claim process if a vehicle is damaged on a city road, but whether anything gets paid depends on the review. I can have the claim information sent to you, or the city clerk's office handles those if you'd rather ask them directly. Do you want me to transfer you after we finish here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, no, that's okay. I just wanted to know. I'll look it up if it happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Now, so the crew can reach you if they have a question, can I get a phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0174. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anh Cohen. A-N-H, and Cohen like it sounds, C-O-H-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anh Cohen, thank you. So that's a repeat pothole on Thames Street near Williams, southbound travel lane, about a foot and a half and deep, previous cold patch washed out in the rain. Anything I missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Oh, can I get a reference number? For the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:48:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Hang on one second while it generates. [pause] Okay, your reference number is PW-26-0306-14. Do you want to write that down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:49:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, one sec. Okay, PW, 26, 0306, 14?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. PW-26-0306-14."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:49:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks. Sorry, I'm a little rushed, my cousin just moved into the apartment upstairs and I'm helping carry boxes, so I'm kind of between trips..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no problem at all, I won't keep you. With the rain going today the crew may be limited, but it's in the system and it'll be sorted with the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:49:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's fine. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Anh. Good luck with the boxes. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:49:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
